  "description": "A boy who longs for a magical world, Gazel had a dream of connecting with a dragon. However, only people with special constitutions can see dragons. one day, while spending days feeling the reality that couldn't get closer to the dream, Gazel meets a dragon that has fallen from the sky....\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/8729), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58617924), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/845028566), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000051104), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8088680), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/asterisk), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=gjc2), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H041900216), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H041900216)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/119897)",
